# Styling

Use `styled-components/native` in the colocated `styles.tsx`. Do not switch those files to StyleSheet or Tailwind.

Theme (keep consistent):

- Background `#1c1c1c` · surface `#2a2a2a` / `#2e2e2e` · text `#ffffff` · muted `#a1a1a1` · danger `#ff4d4d`

Transient props use `$` (`$active`, `$selected`, `$color`) so they are not forwarded to the DOM/native node.

```tsx
export const ButtonDate = styled.TouchableOpacity<{ $active: boolean }>`
  background-color: ${p => (p.$active ? '#ffffff' : '#2a2a2a')};
`;
```

Layout: flex, padding already used in pages (`20px` sides). Respect safe areas. Interactive hits ≥ 44px. Loading/empty/error must be visible, not blank screens.
